  | | |_| | | | (_| |  |  Version 0.2.0
 _/ |\__'_|_|_|\__'_|  |  -Linux-x86_64 (2013-07-09 07:47:39)
|__/                   |  x86_64-linux-gnu

julia> print(1+1)

There is no output here. If you can figure out what is going on here,
I think I will add the Julia engine to knitr in five minutes.

Most other languages accept input from the pipe, e.g.

$ echo 'print(1+1)' | R
> print(1+1)
[1] 2

